# Voxalixa — environment template.
# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and set any values you want to override.

# Where contact + get-started form submissions go.
# When set, the form POSTs JSON to this URL with `Content-Type: application/json`.
# Designed for Formspree / Netlify Forms / any CORS-friendly JSON endpoint.
# Leave blank to fall back to opening the user's mail client with a pre-filled
# `mailto:` link (subject + body populated from the form values).
# VITE_INTAKE_URL=https://formspree.io/f/your_form_id

# Showreel video played inside the "Watch Intro" modal.
# Accepts:
#   - YouTube watch / youtu.be / shorts URL → embedded iframe, autoplays
#   - Vimeo URL                            → embedded iframe, autoplays
#   - .mp4 / .webm / .ogg URL              → native <video> with controls
#   - any other https URL                  → embedded iframe
# Leave blank to show the styled placeholder.
# VITE_VIDEO_URL=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ